Metadata for EGC Decision Support Tool posterior summary.

Parameters:
lambda_A[x]: Abundance of adults (1+ years) in year x.
lambda_R[x]: Abundance of recruits in year x.
prop_1: Proportion of recruits settling on Julian day 91 (April)
prop_2: Proportion of recruits settling on Julian day 152 (June)

Columns:
mean: mean of posterior distribution
sd: standard deviation of posterior distribution
2.5%: lower bound of 95% credibility interval
97.5%: upper bound of 95% credibility interval